* Exercise: Web Crawler

In this exercise you'll use ⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000001⟫'s concurrency features to parallelize a web crawler.

Modify the ⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000002⟫Crawl⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000003⟫ function to fetch URLs in parallel without fetching the same ⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000004⟫ twice.

⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000005⟫Hint⟪GTI18N_bb686393_000006⟫: you can keep a cache of the URLs that have been fetched on a map, but maps alone are not
safe for concurrent use!

